  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TXK7Zw2.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"324\"><strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\">使用前請閱讀</span></strong><br><strong>此資源包適用於最新版Minecraft及以下版本，最低支援至1.8.9版本。</strong></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">此資源包需要&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>Optifine</strong></span>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#396\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp;搭配下方摺疊區列出的模組</strong></span>才能正常運作。</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">⚠️</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>非常重要：</strong>請在此處查看所需模組配置截圖：</span> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fF8e45wQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊這裡</strong></a><strong><br></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">___________________________________________________________________________________</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>以下是讓Better Chickens資源包與Fabric/Sodium相容所需的模組清單。所有模組都需放置於Minecraft模組資料夾中。</strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">⚠️</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>請確保所有模組版本與您的Fabric版本相符。</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Fabric（必需）：<strong><br></strong><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>必要模組：<br><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-entity-models-cem/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>自訂實體模型（CEM）</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cloth Config API</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/completeconfig/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>CompleteConfig</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>實體紋理特性</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>模組選單</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzle/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Puzzle</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br>選用模組（非必需但強烈建議安裝以提升FPS）：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithium/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Lithium</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Phosphor</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Sodium</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n雞隻外觀已更新為更逼真的樣貌。</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">更新後的雞隻模型具有逼真的動畫效果。</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">小雞已更新為真實雛雞的外觀。</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">請在此處查看更好的農場動物資源包：</span></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>（點擊）</strong></span></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-farm-animals\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sqlVake.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></span></strong></a></div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
